  {
    "id": "1166306",
    "original": "小学校低学年の頃、僕は父に俳句を教えられ、俳人に憧れた。七夕の願い事も「はい人になれますように」と書いた。あれから３０年、願いはかなった。今や僕は紛れもない廃人だ。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "1488092",
        "text": "When I was in my first years of grade school, my father taught me a haiku and I longed to be a poet. On my Tanabata wish, I also wrote \"Please make me a poet\". Thirty years have passed and my wish has been granted. I am without doubt an invalid."
      }
    ],
